      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree, the problem with snail markers/pens has not been fixed. Whenever I have used them, the people on the other end say that they can not decipher what it means and it just looks like a bunch of scribbles. The network IK is absolutely not fixed in terms of markers and I hope that the dev team looks more into it to make sure that markers work again, as mutes are a bit screwed at the moment without being able to have working and accurate writing.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
