      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5b6b4e8cb1b04a6db0be465d|full_name}: I don't understand why there's no option to force local IK. Send your own IK to clients, and then calculate the rest locally the same as before. Cut down on network traffic for people who can run it without a performance hit. Plus would fix the pen issue.",
